:''Not to be confused with [[Brainwashed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Cow Cat]].''
'''Malevolent Lion Cat''' is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemy that appears in [[Ruthless Tyrant (Merciless)|The Malevolent Cow]]. It was added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Malevolent Lion Cat
|image = E 664.png
|first appearance = [[Ruthless Tyrant (Merciless)|The Malevolent Cow]]
|money drop = 500¢ - 1,975¢
}}

==Enemy==
Although not difficult on their own, Malevolent Lion Cat is a formidable foe in large numbers due to high DPS and speed. Treat them like a buffed Aku variant of Manic Lion Cat.

==Strategy==
Build up a large stack of Area Attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] to prepare for the large wave on base hit. [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercing Units]] such as [[Talents|Talented]] [[Hayabusa (Uber Rare Cat)|Akuma Hayabusa]]  can help, but are not necessary due to a low Shield Health and even may be prone to dying quickly as a result of Malevolent Lion Cat's pushing power. Do not use Cats with Surge Attacks unless you plan to use [[Actress Cat (Special Cat)|Talented Beefcake Cat]] as your main source of damage. Cats with a chance to Dodge Aku attacks such as [[Matador Cat (Rare Cat)|Talented Bellydance Cat]] work very well against their quick attack rate.

